<title>USA: Tenet Healthcare Q2 shr $0.35 vs $0.31.</title>
<headline>Tenet Healthcare Q2 shr $0.35 vs $0.31.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
