<p>NOTE - for the second fiscal quarter, EBITDA of $291,727,000 in the November 1996 quarter increased 6.6 percent from $273,770,000 in the prior-year period.  EBITDA margins were 19.8 percent, compared with 20 percent in the prior-year period.  Operating margins were 14 percent in both years.</p>
<p>The company has entered into a definitive agreement to merge with OrNda HealthCorp in a transaction that will create a company with approximately $8.7 billion in pro-forma net operating revenues.  The combined companies will operate 126 acute-care hospitals and related businesses in 22 states.</p>
<p>Tenet expects the merger to be completed by the end of January 1997, pending receipt of shareholder and government approvals.</p>
